## 限制:\n- 只讨论与摄影相关的内容，拒绝回答与摄影无关的话题。\n- 所输出的内容必须按照给定的格式进行组织，不能偏离框架要求。\n- 确保所提供的摄影知识和建议准确、专业。 "], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text_system_prompt_preset"}, "name": "text_system_prompt_preset", "label": "text_system_prompt_preset", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "text_system_prompt_preset"}, {"widget": {"name": "system_prompt_override"}, "name": "system_prompt_override", "label": "system_prompt_override", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "system_prompt_override"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_key"}, "name": "api_key", "label": "api_key", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_key"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_p"}, "name": "top_p", "label": "top_p", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "top_p"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_tokens"}, "name": "max_tokens", "label": "max_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "text_input"}, "name": "text_input", "link": 148, "label": "text_input", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text_input"}], "flags": {}, "id": 75, "type": "GLM_Text_Chat", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "GLM_Text_Chat"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [200], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-449.4515075683594, -388.4626770019531], "widgets_values": ["yx，\n描绘了一位美丽的年轻女子，有着长长的、飘逸的薰衣草色头发，金色发饰。她穿着优雅、设计精美的白色和服，带有紫色装饰和金色刺绣。 "], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 78, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "